  "outstanding": [
    "PGU-01–02 derive the matrix-algebra subgroup Haar rescaling asymptotics, the conjugation modulus on the self-dual doubled flag nilradical, the parabolic Haar integration formula up to a constant, the Hilbert–Schmidt volume of the maximal compact product, and the small-ball slab squeeze fixing the Iwasawa constant, while FSV-01–03 supply the arithmetic radical and Levi lattice covolumes for the marked-slice estimate."
  ]
